WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.880
[Subtitles in the making and will be available soon]

01:18.410 --> 01:21.789
[Love has fireworks]

01:21.920 --> 01:24.760
[Episode 28]

01:25.160 --> 01:26.100
Could you

01:26.160 --> 01:27.890
make me another bowl of congee?

01:29.560 --> 01:30.620
I want some congee.

01:33.240 --> 01:33.650
I...

01:34.000 --> 01:34.670
I... Do I

01:34.950 --> 01:37.080
look like someone who can make congee?

01:39.880 --> 01:41.820
No, let me order delivery for you.

01:42.000 --> 01:43.229
Don't order.

01:43.310 --> 01:44.080
It's the middle of the night.

01:44.080 --> 01:46.080
It's not easy for the delivery guys.

01:49.750 --> 01:51.590
How about this? I can teach you.

01:52.190 --> 01:53.789
You have rice at home, right?

01:57.190 --> 01:59.050
Let me look. There should be some.

02:26.000 --> 02:28.250
Brother Fei, keep stirring

02:28.280 --> 02:29.590
so it won't boil over.

02:59.070 --> 03:00.420
Brother Fei, are you okay?

03:00.420 --> 03:01.260
I'm fine.

03:03.590 --> 03:04.400
So annoying.

03:14.630 --> 03:17.070
We can hear the vast, surging

03:17.070 --> 03:18.420
river

03:18.680 --> 03:21.350
and the fiery, heroic national spirit.

03:22.240 --> 03:24.370
The Yellow River and the Yangtze River

03:24.840 --> 03:26.040
originate from Tibet

03:26.350 --> 03:27.840
and flow to the sea,

03:28.160 --> 03:29.630
shining through the ages

03:29.750 --> 03:31.840
and blessing generations.

03:35.160 --> 03:36.490
Thank you, Brother Fei.

03:36.790 --> 03:38.440
I took the medicine and had some porridge.

03:38.440 --> 03:39.960
I feel much better now.

03:41.400 --> 03:42.200
That's great.

03:42.400 --> 03:43.800
Then hurry back and rest.

03:44.750 --> 03:45.610
What about you?

03:46.590 --> 03:47.770
Are you spending the New Year alone?

03:47.770 --> 03:48.320
Me?

03:50.070 --> 03:52.470
No, I have to go to my dad's house for the New Year.

03:52.470 --> 03:53.560
When you called me,

03:53.560 --> 03:55.160
I was just about to head back.

03:56.160 --> 03:57.960
Can you give me a ride then?

03:59.350 --> 04:00.950
I can't get a cab at this hour.

04:08.040 --> 04:09.360
Pack up and let's go.

04:10.830 --> 04:11.630
Now?

04:20.560 --> 04:22.730
Let's all wish

04:22.920 --> 04:26.790
our families happiness and our country prosperity.

04:27.040 --> 04:28.440
Great.

04:28.630 --> 04:29.390
Friends,

04:29.390 --> 04:32.630
the midnight bell is about to ring.

04:32.630 --> 04:34.310
Tell me loudly, everyone.

04:34.310 --> 04:36.510
The sketches in this year's Spring Festival Gala

04:36.510 --> 04:37.800
are quite interesting.

04:37.800 --> 04:39.680
Yes, the singing and dancing are nice too.

04:39.680 --> 04:40.560
If you ask me,

04:40.600 --> 04:41.880
as long as the whole family is together,

04:41.880 --> 04:43.000
everything is enjoyable.

04:43.000 --> 04:45.270
Countdown.

04:45.750 --> 04:46.710
Ten,

04:46.920 --> 04:47.750
nine...

04:47.750 --> 04:49.010
The countdown.
Eight.

04:49.040 --> 04:49.950
Seven,

04:50.120 --> 04:51.000
six,

04:51.270 --> 04:55.710
five, four, three, two, one!

04:56.440 --> 04:58.240
Happy New Year.

05:02.950 --> 05:05.270
Wishing people across the country

05:05.270 --> 05:08.270
a happy New Year.

05:09.360 --> 05:12.150
Bless our great motherland.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.760
I'll go boil these dumplings first.

05:14.880 --> 05:15.480
I'll do it.

05:16.270 --> 05:17.210
You answer the phone.

05:17.210 --> 05:18.220
[Stubborn Lee]

05:17.390 --> 05:18.390
Answer the phone.

05:18.390 --> 05:19.320
Pretentious Li.

05:19.800 --> 05:20.930
It's Xiao Li, right?

05:22.120 --> 05:23.530
Why is he calling me?

05:23.560 --> 05:25.760
Shouldn't he be out partying right now?

05:25.830 --> 05:26.300
Hello?

05:27.120 --> 05:28.920
Happy New Year.

05:32.120 --> 05:32.600
Hello?

05:34.270 --> 05:35.440
Say something.

05:35.440 --> 05:37.390
I called right on time to wish you a Happy New Year.

05:37.390 --> 05:38.990
Can't you give me a reaction?

05:40.040 --> 05:40.600
No.

05:40.600 --> 05:41.880
I'm just a bit surprised.

05:41.880 --> 05:43.010
I didn't expect

05:43.310 --> 05:45.190
you'd remember me despite your busy schedule.

05:43.680 --> 05:45.760
I really miss you

05:46.320 --> 05:47.470
My heart is beating

05:47.240 --> 05:48.360
All right. Happy New Year.

05:48.060 --> 05:50.940
♪ Use my breath to make me miss you ♪ ♪

05:48.510 --> 05:49.290
I'll let you go now.

05:49.290 --> 05:50.520
Go do your thing. I won't bother you.

05:50.520 --> 05:51.620
Hey, wait.

05:51.659 --> 05:52.770
I love you so much

05:51.800 --> 05:52.880
What's the rush?

05:53.120 --> 05:54.050
Give the phone to your dad.

05:53.580 --> 05:56.159
The only you in the world

05:55.560 --> 05:56.240
To my dad?

05:56.790 --> 05:57.659
Why?

05:56.880 --> 06:00.180
You live in my heart

05:57.690 --> 06:00.120
I have to put on a full show for you,

06:00.440 --> 06:01.070
right?

06:01.510 --> 06:05.020
The stars see through the tenderness of the night

06:04.440 --> 06:06.190
Li wants to talk to me, right?

06:05.660 --> 06:08.440
At the street of the city

06:06.240 --> 06:06.960
Come on

06:07.480 --> 06:08.140
Give it to me

06:08.890 --> 06:12.450
The night breeze blows through every window again

06:09.550 --> 06:10.470
Hello, Li.

06:10.490 --> 06:12.700
Happy New Year, Uncle.

06:12.700 --> 06:15.880
[Watching their Little Galaxy secretly]

06:12.920 --> 06:14.240
Happy New Year.

06:14.920 --> 06:15.480
How is it, Uncle?

06:15.480 --> 06:16.800
Did you like the wine I gave you?

06:16.290 --> 06:19.560
Meeting will stir up lazy waiting

06:17.240 --> 06:18.310
Thank you.

06:19.120 --> 06:20.440
The wine is delicious. I like it.

06:20.190 --> 06:23.160
♪ Love lights the fireworks ♪

06:21.040 --> 06:21.880
It's too expensive.

06:21.880 --> 06:23.270
Don't mention it, Uncle.

06:23.270 --> 06:24.600
If you like it, I'll get you a few more bottles.

06:23.640 --> 06:26.770
I fell in love with you without permission

06:25.390 --> 06:27.450
That's fine. Two bottles are enough.

06:27.460 --> 06:31.070
Start to scribble on this romantic cabin

06:27.750 --> 06:29.880
You must come to our house when you have time.

06:29.880 --> 06:31.610
We will make dumplings for you.

06:32.790 --> 06:34.740
I really miss you

06:33.240 --> 06:35.920
Then I wish you a Happy New Year and good health.

06:35.510 --> 06:36.670
A heart is ringing

06:36.240 --> 06:36.880
Okay

06:37.220 --> 06:40.030
♪  Use my breath to make me miss you frequently.] ♪

06:37.510 --> 06:39.280
Say hello to your dad for me.

06:39.480 --> 06:40.770
Take care of yourselves.

06:40.770 --> 06:41.920
I love you so much

06:41.240 --> 06:42.190
Okay, okay.

06:42.190 --> 06:43.040
Thank you.

06:42.580 --> 06:45.440
The only you in the world

06:43.480 --> 06:44.409
Okay, thank you.

06:46.150 --> 06:46.560
Hello.

06:47.240 --> 06:48.530
What were you just saying

06:47.790 --> 06:51.870
You live in my heart

06:48.600 --> 06:50.050
that made my dad so happy?

06:51.830 --> 06:53.090
None of your business.

06:53.450 --> 06:55.450
By the way, when are you coming back?

06:56.480 --> 06:57.150
Why?

06:57.170 --> 06:59.570
Afraid I'll interrupt your couple's time?

07:00.330 --> 07:01.360
What nonsense are you talking about?

07:01.360 --> 07:02.510
What couple's time?

07:02.750 --> 07:04.440
Let me make it clear to you.

07:04.480 --> 07:06.040
I don't have a girlfriend.

07:07.260 --> 07:08.620
What nonsense are you talking about?

07:08.200 --> 07:13.720
You live in my heart

07:09.390 --> 07:10.680
I wanted to ask you,

07:11.040 --> 07:13.700
will you have a lot of stuff the day you come back?

07:29.510 --> 07:30.840
Why are you quiet again?

07:33.440 --> 07:33.920
A lot.

07:35.310 --> 07:36.800
You want to pick me up?

07:37.310 --> 07:38.120
All right.

07:38.390 --> 07:39.600
From now on, whenever I take a flight,

07:39.600 --> 07:40.750
you can pick me up.

07:43.040 --> 07:44.770
Pretend I didn't say anything.

07:45.920 --> 07:47.710
Okay, Happy New Year.

07:48.510 --> 07:49.000
Bye.

07:53.800 --> 07:54.560
Get in.

08:01.000 --> 08:02.600
How about you sit in the back?

08:14.110 --> 08:15.440
Fei, put it down.

08:15.830 --> 08:16.490
Have a seat.

08:18.120 --> 08:19.290
What's wrong, Dad?

08:20.000 --> 08:21.000
Tell me the truth.

08:22.120 --> 08:23.390
What's your relationship

08:23.390 --> 08:24.360
with Li?

08:25.480 --> 08:26.030
He...

08:27.320 --> 08:28.480
He's my boyfriend.

08:29.270 --> 08:30.670
Don't try to brush me off.

08:31.540 --> 08:32.750
If he's your boyfriend,

08:32.750 --> 08:35.460
why were you so surprised to get his call?

08:36.150 --> 08:38.870
Why don't you two have a single photo together?

08:39.720 --> 08:41.380
And why,

08:41.909 --> 08:43.120
on New Year's Eve, didn't you take the initiative

08:43.120 --> 08:44.510
to call him first?

08:47.430 --> 08:48.080
I...

08:53.630 --> 08:54.480
Fine.

08:55.360 --> 08:56.690
I'll tell you the truth.

08:58.550 --> 08:59.810
He's not my boyfriend.

09:01.600 --> 09:04.260
I just didn't want you to worry about me too much.

09:04.320 --> 09:06.800
He was originally just my tenant.

09:07.030 --> 09:09.860
Later, we became good friends,

09:09.890 --> 09:10.970
just like Yu and Jingjing.

09:10.970 --> 09:12.340
Well, Yu and Jingjing

09:12.770 --> 09:14.700
didn't call you right at midnight.

09:14.750 --> 09:15.200
Well,

09:15.320 --> 09:17.250
maybe they were busy.

09:17.600 --> 09:18.750
So Li wasn't busy?

09:19.070 --> 09:21.150
You just told him on the phone to have fun,

09:21.150 --> 09:23.410
which means he has his own social circle.

09:25.190 --> 09:27.750
Calling you at exactly midnight on New Year's Eve,

09:27.750 --> 09:29.390
and sending wine all the way here

09:29.390 --> 09:30.790
for you to give to me...

09:31.670 --> 09:32.800
What does that mean?

09:33.670 --> 09:34.840
Don't you understand?

09:34.840 --> 09:36.640
Dad, you're overthinking this.

09:36.880 --> 09:38.420
He's full of tricks.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.500
You don't know him.

09:40.030 --> 09:43.190
He probably just wants a favor from me.

09:44.600 --> 09:45.200
Fei.

09:45.750 --> 09:46.810
That's not a trick.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.380
That's sincerity.

09:48.500 --> 09:50.910
People who play tricks are usually in business.

09:50.910 --> 09:52.240
They only treat you well

09:52.270 --> 09:53.330
when they need you.

09:54.480 --> 09:57.050
But someone who always thinks of you,

09:57.480 --> 09:58.740
besides your parents,

09:59.000 --> 10:01.480
is the person who stays by your side

10:01.670 --> 10:03.140
and loves you.

10:07.000 --> 10:07.750
But...

10:08.480 --> 10:09.790
He has a girlfriend.

10:10.670 --> 10:11.800
He has a girlfriend?

10:12.430 --> 10:13.560
He doesn't admit it.

10:14.430 --> 10:16.430
But that girl definitely likes him.

10:16.550 --> 10:18.000
Does he like that girl,

10:18.480 --> 10:19.540
or does he like you?

10:20.240 --> 10:20.750
Me?

10:21.690 --> 10:23.780
I'm definitely not his type.

10:25.030 --> 10:26.160
Then do you like him?

10:34.240 --> 10:34.790
Fei,

10:36.350 --> 10:37.860
Li is a good kid.

10:38.320 --> 10:40.200
Don't let your past relationships

10:40.200 --> 10:41.460
become a burden to you.

11:08.270 --> 11:08.930
Here we are.

11:19.600 --> 11:20.930
I like you, Brother Fei.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.120
The first time I saw you,

11:22.120 --> 11:23.030
I fell for you.

11:23.270 --> 11:24.480
When you like someone,

11:24.480 --> 11:26.600
you can't hide the light in your eyes.

11:26.690 --> 11:28.790
But why do you always...
Jinzi.

11:29.630 --> 11:30.890
We are not a good match.

11:37.600 --> 11:39.600
Am I really that bad to you?

11:40.840 --> 11:42.440
Not as good as your landlady?

11:43.590 --> 11:44.210
Jinzi.

11:45.080 --> 11:46.880
You are not bad at all.

11:48.990 --> 11:50.850
But I already have someone I like.

11:54.910 --> 11:56.310
It seems I guessed right.

11:57.550 --> 11:59.360
Actually, since I met you,

11:59.360 --> 12:00.080
I knew

12:00.320 --> 12:02.580
the one you really like is your landlady.

12:02.790 --> 12:04.200
Because every time you mention her,

12:04.200 --> 12:05.600
your eyes sparkle

12:05.600 --> 12:06.510
and shine.

12:08.910 --> 12:10.320
You two have been together for so long.

12:10.320 --> 12:11.390
Since you like her,

12:11.390 --> 12:12.550
why don't you confess to her

12:12.550 --> 12:14.280
and define your relationship?

12:15.040 --> 12:16.990
Are you afraid of being rejected?

12:18.490 --> 12:20.220
You are not the kind of person who drags things out.

12:20.220 --> 12:21.200
Why are you so cautious

12:21.200 --> 12:22.480
when it comes to love?

12:30.230 --> 12:32.940
Maybe I'm still a little afraid and worried.

12:37.590 --> 12:38.950
I don't know since when,

12:41.250 --> 12:43.150
I found that when I'm with her,

12:46.840 --> 12:48.700
I start losing control of myself.

12:49.880 --> 12:51.680
I've never felt this way before.

12:52.390 --> 12:53.750
So I don't dare to take the risk.

12:53.750 --> 12:56.480
Okay, Brother Fei, you don't have to say anymore.

12:57.360 --> 12:58.760
I won't bother you again.

13:00.960 --> 13:01.950
I'm sorry.

13:04.210 --> 13:05.460
But I suggest,

13:06.360 --> 13:07.430
since you love her so much,

13:07.430 --> 13:08.720
don't overthink it.

13:10.030 --> 13:10.720
Be brave.

13:41.240 --> 13:48.300
What I care is what you want

13:49.230 --> 13:55.490
I hope it's what I can give

13:56.210 --> 14:02.520
What I cherish is what I have

14:04.030 --> 14:09.860
♪A little hope is with you♪

14:07.320 --> 14:09.370
You spent New Year's Eve in the box by yourself.

14:09.370 --> 14:10.270
Are you lonely?

14:10.890 --> 14:14.640
Those myths, love words and confessions

14:16.490 --> 14:18.660
Like a firework at midnight

14:16.770 --> 14:18.170
You aren't lonely at all.

14:18.630 --> 14:20.780
You had that pretty influencer girl with you.

14:19.100 --> 14:23.300
[Truth, lie, on the stage]

14:22.040 --> 14:23.780
Does he like that girl

14:23.980 --> 14:24.980
or you?

14:24.080 --> 14:25.800
♪Step on the cotton♪

14:26.230 --> 14:30.410
♪ Bad words, lies, things you don't understand ♪

14:28.790 --> 14:29.920
My dad is asking you.

14:30.080 --> 14:31.580
Do you like her or me?

14:31.090 --> 14:33.080
Stop pretending to be prosperous

14:33.310 --> 14:37.670
Trash in your mind

14:37.390 --> 14:38.790
I am your master.

14:38.230 --> 14:42.240
At this critical moment,

14:39.670 --> 14:42.670
How can an apprentice have inappropriate thoughts about his master?

14:42.670 --> 14:44.200
I knew you would say that.

14:47.620 --> 14:48.690
Smooth talker.

14:51.310 --> 14:53.040
I won't think about it anymore.

14:57.820 --> 15:04.690
What I dream is to be with you

15:05.430 --> 15:11.530
♪ Hold my hand slowly ♪

15:12.190 --> 15:18.560
What I pray for is eternal

15:20.050 --> 15:25.980
I'll be with you day by day

15:26.880 --> 15:30.920
Those myths, love words and confessions

15:31.420 --> 15:36.020
Like a firework at midnight

15:36.490 --> 15:42.520
In my heart

15:38.960 --> 15:40.390
You're usually busy with work.

15:40.390 --> 15:42.050
Eat more now that you're back.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.430
I ate a lot today.

15:43.480 --> 15:44.710
You're so skinny.

15:46.930 --> 15:48.260
I need to take this call.

15:53.750 --> 15:54.840
Hello. What's up?

15:55.160 --> 15:56.670
What do you mean, 'what's up'?

15:56.670 --> 15:58.070
When are you coming back?

15:58.910 --> 16:00.500
Me? On the sixth.

16:01.120 --> 16:01.750
Why?

16:03.080 --> 16:05.360
Is it because your girlfriend can't make stir-fried eggplant strips

16:05.360 --> 16:06.890
to satisfy your cravings?

16:07.240 --> 16:09.190
I don't have a girlfriend.

16:10.000 --> 16:11.840
Why do you always bring that up?

16:12.320 --> 16:12.790
I...

16:14.080 --> 16:14.930
Whether you have a girlfriend or not

16:14.930 --> 16:16.000
is none of my business.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.930
I wish you would move out right now.

16:18.200 --> 16:20.260
I really can't communicate with you.

16:20.380 --> 16:21.420
I'm just asking

16:21.790 --> 16:24.520
why you're only coming back right before work starts on the sixth?

16:24.520 --> 16:25.550
You just resumed working.

16:25.550 --> 16:27.880
Shouldn't you come back early to prepare?

16:27.880 --> 16:28.760
Brother.

16:28.780 --> 16:30.510
I only go home once a year.

16:30.670 --> 16:33.000
What's wrong with staying a few more days?

16:33.350 --> 16:35.910
Who told you not to go home during the National Day holiday?

16:35.910 --> 16:36.630
During the holiday,

16:36.630 --> 16:38.500
my dad and Aunt He went traveling.

16:38.550 --> 16:40.750
What's the point of staying home alone?

16:40.790 --> 16:43.000
No, are you just making conversation?

16:44.510 --> 16:45.360
Or did you

16:46.840 --> 16:48.770
have a fight with your girlfriend?

16:49.320 --> 16:50.450
I'm just wondering.

16:51.520 --> 16:53.910
Do I have to argue with other women

16:54.040 --> 16:55.150
before I can call you?

16:55.150 --> 16:55.600
Right?

17:00.670 --> 17:02.020
[The best love] It's accompanying and growing together.

17:03.110 --> 17:04.900
[All-round discount, surprises keep coming.]

17:06.319 --> 17:07.180
Today

17:08.280 --> 17:09.810
seems to be February 14th.

17:10.800 --> 17:13.819
Are you here to wish me a happy Valentine's Day?

17:13.880 --> 17:14.760
Really?

17:15.800 --> 17:17.260
Today is Valentine's Day?

17:19.280 --> 17:20.780
How come I didn't know?

17:21.359 --> 17:21.760
I...

17:22.319 --> 17:23.520
Are you shopping?

17:24.520 --> 17:25.390
I'll let you go then.

17:25.390 --> 17:26.319
Hanging up. Bye.

17:26.599 --> 17:27.800
Li Yifei, you...

17:38.710 --> 17:39.800
Am I that obvious?

17:40.550 --> 17:41.500
Forget it.

17:43.230 --> 17:43.840
Hello.

17:45.080 --> 17:46.070
Hello, sir.

17:46.280 --> 17:47.850
The rose you are looking at

17:47.880 --> 17:48.860
is our best-selling one

17:48.860 --> 17:50.060
for Valentine's Day.

17:52.800 --> 17:53.230
No.

17:53.390 --> 17:54.760
I want to buy a flower

17:55.240 --> 17:56.970
that shows I like her,

17:57.670 --> 17:59.650
but not too obviously.

18:00.050 --> 18:00.590
You know?

18:00.610 --> 18:01.470
Just something

18:03.350 --> 18:04.430
a bit special.

18:05.140 --> 18:06.150
Special flowers

18:06.600 --> 18:07.270
are like...

18:07.360 --> 18:08.860
You know how it is on Valentine's Day.

18:08.860 --> 18:09.690
Everyone gives roses.

18:09.690 --> 18:11.020
I think it's too cliché.

18:11.430 --> 18:13.110
What should I give?

18:13.140 --> 18:13.820
Well,

18:13.840 --> 18:16.440
I don't want her to know that giving her flowers

18:17.790 --> 18:19.030
is a confession.

18:19.670 --> 18:20.230
You know?

18:20.730 --> 18:22.790
But I really do like her.

18:23.260 --> 18:25.040
So tell me, for this kind of symptom,

18:25.040 --> 18:26.970
what kind of flowers should I send?

18:27.110 --> 18:29.540
So let me summarize it for you.

18:29.600 --> 18:31.740
She didn't know you liked her before,

18:31.760 --> 18:32.760
and in the future,

18:32.770 --> 18:35.230
you don't want her to like you either. Right?

18:35.630 --> 18:36.190
No.

18:36.560 --> 18:38.180
It was like that before,

18:38.210 --> 18:39.500
but as for the future,

18:39.520 --> 18:40.650
I'm really not sure.

18:42.610 --> 18:44.710
Are there? Are there any flowers like that?

18:44.710 --> 18:45.270
Well...

18:45.450 --> 18:47.540
I'm not quite sure what you need.

18:47.600 --> 18:48.330
That's okay.

18:49.070 --> 18:50.130
I'll keep looking.

18:50.800 --> 18:52.130
Take your time looking.

19:02.980 --> 19:04.110
What flower is this?

19:05.040 --> 19:06.180
These are daisies.

19:06.320 --> 19:07.300
The language of daisies

19:07.300 --> 19:09.100
is love hidden deep in the heart.

19:12.820 --> 19:14.710
[You're the love I've hidden in my heart.]

19:20.700 --> 19:21.570
I'll take this.

19:22.080 --> 19:22.610
Okay.

19:34.430 --> 19:35.130
How was it?

19:35.470 --> 19:37.530
Did I do okay playing your boyfriend?

19:37.990 --> 19:39.110
You did great.

19:39.450 --> 19:41.110
I'll treat you to a meal later.

19:41.360 --> 19:41.780
Sure.

19:44.150 --> 19:44.990
Well...

19:45.430 --> 19:47.950
If you're still single next New Year,

19:48.760 --> 19:50.290
I can go back with you again.

19:51.610 --> 19:53.270
Let's talk about it next year.

19:53.430 --> 19:55.670
Going back is just a formality anyway.

19:57.320 --> 19:58.120
What's wrong?

19:58.560 --> 20:00.560
You saw the atmosphere in my family.

20:01.280 --> 20:03.470
I've always been distant from my dad since childhood.

20:03.470 --> 20:05.520
Every time we talk,

20:05.630 --> 20:07.030
we always end up arguing.

20:07.080 --> 20:08.540
Then my sister came along.

20:09.710 --> 20:10.600
As for my mom,

20:10.630 --> 20:12.810
she's always caught in the middle.

20:13.080 --> 20:14.280
Now that I'm grown up,

20:14.520 --> 20:15.580
the only thing I can do

20:15.580 --> 20:17.640
is visit less to avoid annoying them.

20:19.670 --> 20:22.400
Actually, your parents care about you very much.

20:23.190 --> 20:24.520
That day in the kitchen,

20:24.520 --> 20:25.580
your mom told me...

20:26.380 --> 20:28.640
Right, what did my mom say to you that day?

20:32.600 --> 20:34.730
You'd better listen to this yourself.

20:35.670 --> 20:37.140
You even recorded this?

20:37.800 --> 20:39.400
I thought you should hear it,

20:40.150 --> 20:41.230
so I recorded it.

20:49.350 --> 20:50.220
Dajun,

20:50.670 --> 20:53.070
you must treat Xiaoyu better in the future.

20:53.280 --> 20:55.080
If I find out you've bullied her,

20:55.080 --> 20:56.140
I won't let you off.

20:57.150 --> 20:58.010
I know, Auntie.

20:58.410 --> 21:00.040
You've seen the situation in our family.

21:00.040 --> 21:01.670
Xiaoyu's father has a bad temper.

21:01.670 --> 21:02.150
As for Xiaoyu,

21:02.150 --> 21:03.560
every time she comes back from Shanghai,

21:03.560 --> 21:05.150
her father is like this,

21:05.170 --> 21:06.430
refusing to talk properly.

21:06.430 --> 21:08.030
He suffers for his own pride.

21:08.780 --> 21:09.840
Over the years,

21:10.120 --> 21:11.630
Xiaoyu has been out there on her own,

21:11.630 --> 21:13.040
suffering a lot of grievances

21:13.040 --> 21:14.600
and enduring a lot of hardships.

21:14.600 --> 21:15.740
As parents,

21:16.390 --> 21:18.080
we know we owe her a lot.

21:19.320 --> 21:20.190
Actually,

21:20.670 --> 21:22.700
we don't care about houses,

21:22.800 --> 21:24.730
cars, or household registration.

21:24.840 --> 21:26.340
We just hope she

21:27.120 --> 21:28.190
lives a happy life.

21:28.280 --> 21:30.280
Dajun, I hope you

21:30.300 --> 21:31.760
can give her a stable home.

21:32.760 --> 21:35.600
I will be grateful to you from the bottom of my heart.

21:35.600 --> 21:36.730
Don't worry, Ma'am.

21:36.990 --> 21:38.800
I will definitely treat Xiaoyu well.

21:38.800 --> 21:39.760
I promise you.

21:52.800 --> 21:53.560
Thank you.

21:57.120 --> 22:00.020
Your parents really care about you

22:00.320 --> 22:01.300
and feel for you.

22:02.080 --> 22:05.090
They know you work hard on your own out there,

22:05.630 --> 22:06.990
and it's not easy.

22:07.680 --> 22:10.940
I think they just aren't good at expressing it,

22:11.360 --> 22:12.950
but they are good parents.

22:13.390 --> 22:14.790
You don't have to envy me.

22:17.540 --> 22:18.500
I didn't expect

22:20.040 --> 22:22.170
you to be so good at comforting people.

22:23.800 --> 22:24.430
Besides,

22:24.600 --> 22:25.670
since you're in Shanghai,

22:25.670 --> 22:26.910
don't you still have me

22:26.910 --> 22:28.660
and friends like Qian Fei?

22:28.880 --> 22:29.650
If you have any problems,

22:29.650 --> 22:30.800
you can always tell us.

22:30.800 --> 22:32.400
We will definitely help you.

22:32.840 --> 22:34.700
How can you be the same as Qian Fei?

22:36.230 --> 22:38.280
We are all good friends anyway.

22:40.190 --> 22:40.710
When we go back,

22:40.710 --> 22:43.640
I'll still need your help for the dance competition.

22:44.280 --> 22:47.630
Okay, then thank you, my good friend.

22:47.910 --> 22:48.840
You're welcome.

22:51.550 --> 22:52.270
Silly.

22:54.260 --> 22:54.980
Nothing.

23:18.990 --> 23:19.670
Brother.

23:20.840 --> 23:21.620
You've been messing with this flower

23:21.620 --> 23:23.090
for half an hour.

23:23.360 --> 23:23.880
What,

23:24.430 --> 23:26.490
planning to enter the flower market?

23:27.840 --> 23:29.640
Too tacky. Too tacky. Too tacky.

23:29.990 --> 23:32.590
Can you stop thinking about money all the time?

23:32.670 --> 23:34.200
Can't you be a bit more pure?

23:34.310 --> 23:35.360
Sorry, sorry.

23:35.800 --> 23:37.330
I wasn't talking about you.

23:39.010 --> 23:41.810
Let me ask you, looking at this pot of flowers,

23:43.320 --> 23:44.720
do you have any thoughts?

23:47.850 --> 23:48.830
Any thoughts?

23:53.560 --> 23:54.690
Tomb-Sweeping Day.

23:56.440 --> 23:57.960
Don't smash it, I'm telling you.

23:57.960 --> 23:59.510
Don't break this thing.

23:59.630 --> 24:01.060
I'm unboxing it for you.

24:04.080 --> 24:05.680
Change your way of thinking.

24:06.040 --> 24:07.760
Think like an artist.

24:08.040 --> 24:08.630
See?

24:12.910 --> 24:13.540
Bro,

24:14.180 --> 24:15.450
are you sick?

24:18.150 --> 24:18.630
I feel like you

24:18.630 --> 24:20.490
really can't communicate with me normally.

24:20.490 --> 24:20.980
Really.

24:23.150 --> 24:25.500
Even the little girl at the flower shop gets it.

24:25.500 --> 24:28.030
These are daisies. They're very special.

24:28.670 --> 24:29.760
Their language is

24:29.910 --> 24:33.470
the unspeakable love hidden deep in the heart.

24:40.070 --> 24:41.140
Unspeakable.

24:42.750 --> 24:44.810
You just don't have the guts to say it.

24:45.050 --> 24:45.910
Unbelievable.

24:46.080 --> 24:48.130
You just have bad taste.

24:48.160 --> 24:49.890
I don't even want to talk to you.

24:51.040 --> 24:52.460
You have good taste?

24:52.720 --> 24:53.540
Where did Zihao

24:53.540 --> 24:54.940
get these plates for you?

24:55.400 --> 24:57.000
Just tell me if it looks good.

24:57.560 --> 24:59.320
Are we really going to use this to eat?

24:59.320 --> 25:00.850
Things are meant to be used.

25:01.150 --> 25:01.600
Right?

25:02.840 --> 25:03.450
I...

25:07.490 --> 25:08.100
Speak.

25:08.690 --> 25:09.810
Hey, Li Yifei.

25:10.120 --> 25:12.450
There's a sudden bug in the mobile app.

25:12.800 --> 25:14.110
And our capital chain has broken again.

25:14.110 --> 25:16.390
The remaining funds aren't enough for the fix.

25:16.390 --> 25:18.250
Should we start figuring out a way

25:18.360 --> 25:19.470
to raise funds?

25:20.910 --> 25:22.120
If we get financing now,

25:22.120 --> 25:24.080
it'll be hard to control the app's direction later.

25:24.080 --> 25:24.610
You know?

25:24.750 --> 25:25.720
Absolutely not.

25:25.840 --> 25:26.840
Give me a day.

25:27.330 --> 25:28.260
I'll solve it.

25:29.120 --> 25:30.340
What can you do?

25:31.280 --> 25:32.710
I can't explain it clearly over the phone.

25:32.710 --> 25:33.840
Wait to hear from me.

25:41.510 --> 25:42.380
Listen.

25:43.190 --> 25:44.320
I have a task for you.

25:45.840 --> 25:46.710
I'm taking a trip to Sanya.

25:46.710 --> 25:48.150
Help me take care of this plant.

25:48.150 --> 25:49.460
Sunlight, air, and water,

25:49.460 --> 25:50.590
it needs all of them.

25:51.150 --> 25:52.040
Wait, sunlight, air, and water...

25:52.040 --> 25:53.950
Why don't you just take it to Sanya?

25:53.950 --> 25:54.880
My precious love

25:54.900 --> 25:56.700
shouldn't endure a tiring trip.

25:57.340 --> 25:59.470
You're only going to Sanya for one day.

26:22.840 --> 26:23.990
[Stubborn Li]

26:30.990 --> 26:31.630
Hello.

26:32.670 --> 26:34.600
When are you coming back on the 6th?

26:36.270 --> 26:37.800
Bro, it's only the 4th.

26:37.820 --> 26:39.880
Aren't you tired of asking every day?

26:39.880 --> 26:41.340
Just answer the question.

26:42.190 --> 26:43.050
Around 1:00 PM.

26:45.470 --> 26:46.850
Could it be that

26:46.950 --> 26:47.760
you and your girlfriend

26:47.760 --> 26:48.800
made a mess of the house,

26:48.800 --> 26:50.470
and you want me to come back later?

26:50.470 --> 26:51.850
Let me reiterate.

26:51.880 --> 26:53.340
I don't have a girlfriend.

26:54.340 --> 26:55.300
Then why?

26:56.720 --> 26:57.470
Nothing.

26:57.880 --> 26:58.450
Just wait.

26:58.450 --> 26:59.650
I'll pick you up then.

27:01.610 --> 27:02.470
I'm hanging up.

27:14.280 --> 27:15.280
Why?

27:18.530 --> 27:19.590
In a hurry to see me?

27:24.950 --> 27:25.910
Why exactly?

27:31.880 --> 27:33.480
Who were you just talking to?

27:33.800 --> 27:35.360
Dad, you scared me.

27:37.080 --> 27:38.120
Xiao Li, right?

27:39.800 --> 27:41.400
You already knew, so why ask?

27:42.430 --> 27:43.760
Look, you're blushing.

27:44.280 --> 27:45.210
No, I'm not.

27:47.040 --> 27:48.440
I'm going back to my room.

27:53.520 --> 27:55.520
Xiao Fei is heading back the day after tomorrow.

27:55.520 --> 27:56.690
Why are you standing there alone,

27:56.690 --> 27:58.020
grinning like an idiot?

27:58.080 --> 27:58.710
This kid

27:59.520 --> 28:00.780
should be pretty good.

28:01.630 --> 28:02.690
Looks quite happy.

28:05.670 --> 28:06.390
Maomao.

28:08.040 --> 28:10.580
Come hang out with me on the yacht later.

28:14.040 --> 28:15.080
I'm asking you.

28:16.990 --> 28:18.120
Are you going or not?

28:19.850 --> 28:20.510
Maomao.

28:22.360 --> 28:23.560
Happy New Year, Dad.

28:24.990 --> 28:26.470
I brought you some of our Fulaxida

28:26.470 --> 28:27.530
homegrown apples.

28:27.600 --> 28:28.900
These are organic and pesticide-free.

28:28.900 --> 28:31.300
You can eat them directly without washing.

28:32.120 --> 28:32.670
No.

28:34.090 --> 28:34.620
I mean...

28:38.230 --> 28:40.040
We live in the same city,

28:40.080 --> 28:41.880
but you never bother to visit me.

28:42.680 --> 28:44.430
Yet you flew all the way here.

28:45.930 --> 28:46.990
Isn't it perfectly natural

28:46.990 --> 28:48.390
for a son to wish his dad a happy New Year?

28:48.390 --> 28:48.990
True.

28:49.990 --> 28:50.520
Alright.

28:51.390 --> 28:52.880
The New Year greetings are done.

28:52.880 --> 28:54.280
Is there something else?

28:55.760 --> 28:56.230
Yes.

28:57.840 --> 28:58.770
Bail me out, Dad.

29:00.600 --> 29:02.330
It's tough out there, isn't it?

29:05.520 --> 29:07.880
When are you coming back to the group?

29:09.630 --> 29:10.170
Dad.

29:10.270 --> 29:12.800
This time I really have to save Fulaxida first.

29:12.800 --> 29:13.600
You are

29:14.630 --> 29:15.630
just too naive.

29:16.670 --> 29:18.360
You only know how to bail things out,

29:18.360 --> 29:20.220
but not how to find the loopholes.

29:20.320 --> 29:21.650
What do you mean by that?

29:27.080 --> 29:28.350
Are you saying

29:30.240 --> 29:31.690
that Fulaxida's problem

29:32.330 --> 29:34.080
was a deliberate trap?

29:36.950 --> 29:37.630
Okay.

29:38.200 --> 29:39.490
You're not too stupid.

29:42.400 --> 29:43.480
I knew it.

29:43.610 --> 29:45.150
How could a tech guy like Ma Li

29:45.150 --> 29:47.360
start supporting rushed financing?

29:48.880 --> 29:49.930
Seems like he really got in touch

29:49.930 --> 29:51.390
with someone formidable.

29:53.190 --> 29:53.760
Tell me.

29:54.390 --> 29:55.990
How much funding do you need?

29:56.350 --> 29:57.340
Thirty million.

30:03.240 --> 30:06.040
Did you burn through all the previous investment?

30:08.600 --> 30:10.000
At least twenty million.

30:16.040 --> 30:16.570
Alright.

30:17.800 --> 30:18.930
Let me tell you,

30:19.150 --> 30:21.010
you're the only one in this world.

30:21.190 --> 30:23.520
How dare you ask me for money so blatantly.

30:24.990 --> 30:26.060
I won't take it for free.

30:26.060 --> 30:27.090
A six-month term

30:27.710 --> 30:28.770
with 10% interest.

30:28.910 --> 30:29.670
15%.

30:33.630 --> 30:35.040
So shrewd.

30:35.060 --> 30:37.120
Did you mean to say 'cunning'?

30:37.320 --> 30:38.800
Just eat your apple.

30:39.190 --> 30:41.650
Don't forget. No need to wash it. Just eat it.

30:42.840 --> 30:43.370
Let's go.

30:43.420 --> 30:44.820
I'm off to catch a flight.

30:45.800 --> 30:47.560
Hey, why don't you have a meal before you leave?

30:47.560 --> 30:48.490
There's no time.

30:58.310 --> 30:59.970
Yifei is making progress now.

31:00.190 --> 31:01.650
He knows to give you gifts.

31:02.230 --> 31:03.330
Currently, our group's

31:03.330 --> 31:05.390
overseas business is not doing well.

31:05.950 --> 31:06.930
Actually, you need

31:06.930 --> 31:08.710
Yifei to come back and help you more.

31:08.710 --> 31:09.440
Why do you...

31:11.110 --> 31:13.280
How can a father complain to his son?

31:15.360 --> 31:15.990
Besides,

31:16.120 --> 31:17.230
my 20 million

31:17.910 --> 31:19.910
must be used where it's needed most.

31:21.950 --> 31:23.230
You mean...

31:24.760 --> 31:25.960
Don't worry about it.

31:26.280 --> 31:27.140
Come here. You,

31:27.230 --> 31:28.560
help me wash the apples.

31:28.670 --> 31:29.120
Okay.

31:29.230 --> 31:30.710
He said they don't need washing.

31:30.710 --> 31:32.120
Why do I find that hard to believe?

31:32.120 --> 31:32.730
I don't believe it either.

31:32.730 --> 31:33.930
You'd better wash it.

31:34.190 --> 31:34.710
Okay.

31:35.040 --> 31:36.570
Make sure you wash it clean.

32:12.810 --> 32:15.340
You shut down my company last time.

32:15.760 --> 32:17.420
Now you are giving me a chance.

32:17.760 --> 32:19.280
Did you already plan this out

32:19.280 --> 32:20.040
when you were

32:20.040 --> 32:20.990
at Shanlifang?

32:21.600 --> 32:22.390
To be honest,

32:22.670 --> 32:23.630
I never liked

32:23.630 --> 32:25.160
the product you developed.

32:26.280 --> 32:27.430
But for the Fulaxida mobile app,

32:27.430 --> 32:28.960
I think you can give it a try.

32:30.320 --> 32:31.050
Why should I?

32:38.150 --> 32:39.370
This mobile app

32:39.630 --> 32:40.880
allows all consumers

32:40.910 --> 32:42.730
to see how the products they buy

32:42.880 --> 32:45.230
are planted and harvested,

32:45.320 --> 32:46.970
how much water is used on each plot of land,

32:46.970 --> 32:47.670
and how much fertilizer is applied.

32:47.670 --> 32:49.270
Even a single piece of fruit

32:49.710 --> 32:51.560
can be traced when it reaches the consumer.

32:51.560 --> 32:53.840
But how do we ensure that these agricultural products,

32:53.840 --> 32:55.470
supported by this mobile app,

32:55.470 --> 32:56.990
have a competitive value

32:56.990 --> 32:58.380
that ordinary agricultural products lack?

32:58.380 --> 32:59.150
At the same time, we can ensure

32:59.150 --> 33:00.630
that the farmers participating in the planting,

33:00.630 --> 33:01.590
since all the produce

33:01.590 --> 33:03.190
is branded with their names,

33:03.280 --> 33:04.320
will cherish

33:04.340 --> 33:06.470
their reputation and integrity more.

33:06.560 --> 33:07.360
At present,

33:07.560 --> 33:09.360
this app isn't quite mature yet.

33:10.710 --> 33:11.960
So I thought of you.

33:13.470 --> 33:14.800
Because your R&D concept

33:14.800 --> 33:16.390
fits Fulaxida perfectly.

33:16.910 --> 33:17.560
So I believe

33:17.560 --> 33:19.020
you can improve this app.

33:19.280 --> 33:21.740
I also believe you can turn this possibility

33:22.390 --> 33:23.320
into reality.

33:30.150 --> 33:31.860
It's like a dream.

33:33.040 --> 33:34.370
I never thought

33:34.710 --> 33:36.660
an app originally designed to

33:36.690 --> 33:38.520
take hotel services to the next level

33:38.520 --> 33:40.650
could be transplanted to an agricultural production base.

33:40.650 --> 33:41.060
Is

33:41.950 --> 33:43.080
this really feasible?

33:43.080 --> 33:43.800
Of course.

33:44.600 --> 33:45.890
Fulaxida

33:46.040 --> 33:48.570
is exactly the stage for you and your products

33:48.650 --> 33:49.960
to show your value.

33:50.520 --> 33:52.340
Although funds are not abundant right now,

33:52.340 --> 33:53.840
it's enough to move forward.

33:53.840 --> 33:54.620
About the follow-up support,

33:54.620 --> 33:56.350
you don't need to worry either.

33:57.120 --> 33:58.160
Most of the investors I met before

33:58.160 --> 33:59.640
were aloof.

33:59.720 --> 34:01.120
I just felt

34:01.140 --> 34:03.470
they were just tagging along for a piece of the pie.

34:03.470 --> 34:04.730
But you are different.

34:04.820 --> 34:06.270
Investors and entrepreneurs

34:06.270 --> 34:07.650
must always complement each other

34:07.650 --> 34:09.110
and be honest with each other.

34:09.110 --> 34:11.040
Otherwise, how can we be partners?

34:12.949 --> 34:14.130
Since you mentioned honesty,

34:14.130 --> 34:15.460
I won't hide it anymore.

34:15.949 --> 34:18.409
I've had a question in my mind for a long time.

34:18.880 --> 34:20.389
It's true that you work in an investment bank.

34:20.389 --> 34:22.580
But few investment bankers switch to being investors.

34:22.580 --> 34:24.980
This requires not only vision and courage,

34:25.030 --> 34:26.690
but also financial reserves.

34:28.570 --> 34:30.030
What are you trying to say?

34:31.469 --> 34:33.330
Qiansheng Manufacturing Group.

34:35.429 --> 34:36.469
How did you know?

34:37.679 --> 34:38.280
Before New Year's Day,

34:38.280 --> 34:39.719
I went to pitch myself to Chairman Li,

34:39.719 --> 34:40.300
but failed.

34:40.300 --> 34:42.790
But I saw the photo on the desk.

34:43.510 --> 34:44.659
It should be an old photo

34:44.659 --> 34:45.989
of your family of three.

34:46.389 --> 34:47.469
I was sure then.

34:48.110 --> 34:48.679
Because

34:49.199 --> 34:50.949
your appearance and personality

34:50.949 --> 34:52.760
are too similar to Chairman Li's.

34:52.760 --> 34:53.719
Good eyes.

34:53.989 --> 34:56.030
Then you have even less to worry about now.

34:56.030 --> 34:57.660
My problem isn't with your identity.

34:57.660 --> 34:58.970
I highly respect

34:58.990 --> 35:00.590
your choice not to go public.

35:00.700 --> 35:02.050
I'm just curious.

35:03.280 --> 35:04.940
You care so much about Qian Fei,

35:04.940 --> 35:06.940
and you spend day and night with her.

35:07.160 --> 35:08.320
But looking at her,

35:08.410 --> 35:09.810
she doesn't seem to know.

35:11.540 --> 35:12.960
I don't care about her.

35:13.680 --> 35:16.480
And we don't exactly spend day and night together.

35:17.030 --> 35:18.790
I told her I was a rich kid,

35:19.160 --> 35:20.390
but she didn't believe me.

35:20.390 --> 35:21.800
Whether she believes it depends entirely on

35:21.800 --> 35:24.880
whether you've thought through the consequences of going public.

35:24.880 --> 35:26.560
As for whether you care about her,

35:26.560 --> 35:28.520
I think anyone who sees the way you look at her

35:28.520 --> 35:29.690
would understand.

35:30.280 --> 35:31.810
Just like now. Look at yourself.

35:31.810 --> 35:33.030
You are completely different

35:33.030 --> 35:34.510
from the guy who was just talking so confidently.

35:34.510 --> 35:35.800
Come on, cut it out.

35:36.680 --> 35:37.780
I am your investor now,

35:37.780 --> 35:38.910
so watch your mouth.

35:39.550 --> 35:40.110
Yes.

35:40.240 --> 35:42.220
How could I mock my investor?

35:42.240 --> 35:44.200
Don't worry. I'll keep your secret.

35:44.200 --> 35:44.910
From now on,

35:45.640 --> 35:46.970
we only talk about work.

35:47.430 --> 35:48.240
You said it.

35:49.320 --> 35:51.250
I have things to do. I'll get going.

36:15.430 --> 36:16.880
Honey! Honey!

36:16.900 --> 36:17.560
I signed it!

36:17.960 --> 36:19.300
I signed it! I signed it!

36:20.800 --> 36:21.280
Really?

36:21.280 --> 36:21.840
I signed it! I signed it!

36:21.840 --> 36:23.040
Let me see! Let me see!

36:23.060 --> 36:25.120
The new investor has been confirmed.

36:25.360 --> 36:26.950
My app and my project

36:26.950 --> 36:28.770
can finally get back on track.

36:29.070 --> 36:30.400
That's great!

36:32.510 --> 36:34.170
You've worked so hard lately.

36:34.550 --> 36:35.880
Indeed, I have.

36:37.390 --> 36:38.030
Jingjing.

36:39.430 --> 36:40.890
You've been through a lot.

36:41.110 --> 36:42.550
What are you talking about?

36:42.550 --> 36:43.640
I'm just happy for you.

36:43.640 --> 36:45.170
I don't feel wronged at all.

36:46.950 --> 36:47.720
Jingjing.

36:48.720 --> 36:50.050
I actually understand.

36:50.760 --> 36:53.470
You didn't let me go home with you for the New Year this year

36:53.470 --> 36:55.050
because you were afraid your parents would ask about my work

36:55.050 --> 36:56.110
and worry about me.

36:56.840 --> 36:58.360
And when you went to my home for the New Year,

36:58.360 --> 36:59.960
you did chores for my parents

37:00.000 --> 37:01.280
and spoke up for me.

37:03.040 --> 37:04.130
I know it all.

37:06.070 --> 37:06.720
Alright.

37:07.240 --> 37:08.770
No more being sentimental.

37:09.510 --> 37:10.040
Let's go.

37:10.590 --> 37:12.640
Let's buy some fish and celebrate at home.

37:12.640 --> 37:13.170
Let's go.

37:14.550 --> 37:15.640
What fish?

37:15.760 --> 37:16.680
We're eating out today.

37:16.680 --> 37:18.070
We're having a good meal no matter what.

37:18.070 --> 37:18.640
Really?

37:19.800 --> 37:20.330
Let's go.

37:21.050 --> 37:24.280
[Exit]

37:31.590 --> 37:33.640
Hello? You're quite on time.

37:34.030 --> 37:34.750
Five minutes.

37:34.750 --> 37:35.880
Wait for me for another five minutes.

37:35.880 --> 37:37.010
I'll be right there.

38:14.680 --> 38:15.550
Have you waited long?

38:15.550 --> 38:17.010
Traffic was bad on the way.

38:17.030 --> 38:18.090
Only five minutes.

38:18.160 --> 38:19.220
Okay, give it to me.

38:22.850 --> 38:23.940
By the way.

38:23.960 --> 38:27.470
My dad insisted on bringing Comrade Li some local specialties.

38:27.470 --> 38:28.840
Uncle gave this to me?

38:29.200 --> 38:30.890
I must finish it tonight.

38:32.110 --> 38:34.310
Why do you look so haggard?

38:35.990 --> 38:37.310
There was a problem with Fulaxida.

38:37.310 --> 38:38.610
I've been dealing with it.

38:38.610 --> 38:40.260
Is it resolved now?

38:41.030 --> 38:41.910
I took a flight.

38:41.930 --> 38:43.160
And went to the suburbs.

38:43.160 --> 38:44.000
It's fine now.

38:45.360 --> 38:46.510
In just over a day,

38:46.510 --> 38:47.830
you've done so much.

38:49.700 --> 38:51.480
Because I'm capable.

38:52.250 --> 38:53.260
Li Yifei.

38:55.320 --> 38:56.020
Well.

38:56.050 --> 38:57.090
Let me drive.

38:58.320 --> 38:58.820
You.

39:00.550 --> 39:01.200
Hurry up.

39:01.220 --> 39:01.790
Fine.

39:24.380 --> 39:26.510
You said you didn't have a girlfriend.

39:26.680 --> 39:28.140
What's with the slippers?

39:30.360 --> 39:31.100
They're Qi's.

39:31.100 --> 39:33.280
I asked her to come over and help me water the plants.

39:33.280 --> 39:34.510
Qi's?

39:35.950 --> 39:36.950
Watering plants?

39:37.590 --> 39:39.310
You never watered my plants.

39:39.450 --> 39:40.850
Why would Qi come to help?

39:41.450 --> 39:43.080
I bought a plant too.

39:43.860 --> 39:44.920
You bought a plant?

39:45.070 --> 39:46.220
You can't even take care of yourself.

39:46.220 --> 39:47.250
And you want to raise a plant?

39:47.250 --> 39:48.450
Why would I lie to you?

39:49.950 --> 39:50.510
See that?

39:53.240 --> 39:54.440
You really bought it.

39:55.350 --> 39:57.520
I have to say, it looks pretty good.

39:57.720 --> 39:58.400
You like it?

39:58.760 --> 39:59.640
It's yours.

40:00.230 --> 40:01.090
Really?

40:01.970 --> 40:03.130
Hurry up and pack your things.

40:03.130 --> 40:04.510
I'll order some food first.

40:04.510 --> 40:05.940
Then save my number.

40:06.030 --> 40:07.030
Go get some sleep.

40:07.910 --> 40:10.170
Did you forget how long I slept in the car?

40:39.390 --> 40:40.320
Dinner is ready.

40:40.340 --> 40:41.750
Come out and eat.

40:42.220 --> 40:43.280
Coming.

41:01.360 --> 41:02.470
You changed the tableware.

41:02.470 --> 41:03.600
Where is the old set?

41:03.760 --> 41:05.200
I broke that set,

41:05.220 --> 41:06.990
so I bought you a new one to replace it.

41:06.990 --> 41:07.320
Well,

41:07.510 --> 41:08.840
this is so expensive.

41:09.510 --> 41:12.320
If I had known, you could have just transferred the money to me.

41:12.320 --> 41:13.880
Transferring money is an option.

41:13.880 --> 41:14.830
But first,

41:14.950 --> 41:16.510
transferring money might not calm you down.

41:16.510 --> 41:17.070
Second,

41:17.470 --> 41:18.910
you might just put the money in the bank,

41:18.910 --> 41:21.370
which wouldn't give you this secret thrill.

41:22.640 --> 41:24.440
Who said I'm secretly thrilled?

41:25.430 --> 41:27.360
I just sneaked a piece of this beef.

41:27.910 --> 41:29.550
Your parents are really good cooks.

41:29.550 --> 41:30.320
It's delicious.

41:30.320 --> 41:32.850
You only ordered a salad and a pot of porridge?

41:33.800 --> 41:34.910
What do you mean 'ordered'?

41:34.910 --> 41:36.330
I made them myself.

41:36.680 --> 41:37.480
You made them?

41:37.720 --> 41:39.180
You know how to make these?

41:40.990 --> 41:43.450
I picked it up from watching you cook so much.

41:43.810 --> 41:44.690
Impossible.

41:46.240 --> 41:47.460
Okay, okay. I learned a bit online.

41:47.460 --> 41:48.060
Alright.

41:48.360 --> 41:48.950
On such a cold day,

41:48.950 --> 41:50.430
I came back to make you some stomach-warming porridge,

41:50.430 --> 41:53.290
and you're still asking questions and being picky.

41:53.470 --> 41:55.330
Are you really this considerate?

41:55.950 --> 41:57.510
Always.

41:58.030 --> 41:58.590
Eat up.

42:01.680 --> 42:02.480
What's wrong?

42:04.880 --> 42:05.800
Nothing. Don't worry about me.

42:05.800 --> 42:06.840
Let me see.
It's okay.

42:06.840 --> 42:08.640
Let me see.
Don’t worry about me.

42:10.240 --> 42:11.340
Is... is it a burn?

42:11.360 --> 42:13.760
Did you burn yourself making the porridge?

42:13.950 --> 42:15.550
I'm not used to it. It's okay.

42:17.380 --> 42:18.980
I'll put some ointment on it.

42:26.720 --> 42:28.100
Did you find the medicine?

42:28.100 --> 42:29.250
It hurts like hell.

42:41.200 --> 42:42.000
What's wrong?

42:44.390 --> 42:45.450
What are you doing?

42:46.680 --> 42:47.770
Whose hair is this?

42:48.350 --> 42:49.130
What hair?

42:49.960 --> 42:51.420
Come and see for yourself.

42:52.090 --> 42:53.520
[In the next episode, there are fireworks in love.]

42:53.930 --> 42:54.940
Director Fang

42:55.110 --> 42:56.510
was taken away by people from Shanlifang.

42:56.510 --> 42:57.740
Do you know why?

42:59.580 --> 43:01.720
The incident in the Shanlifang Hotel room before the New Year,

43:01.720 --> 43:02.580
did you forget?

43:05.220 --> 43:07.020
What did you want to see me about?

43:07.890 --> 43:08.990
I have always

43:09.250 --> 43:11.440
regarded you as my idol,

43:11.730 --> 43:13.740
and strived to be someone like you.

43:14.800 --> 43:16.720
But I don't understand why.

43:18.020 --> 43:19.970
Why did you tip off Dian Sansan?
